{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Juice WRLD & Future]\n[00:10.48]They ask me how high am I\n[00:12.82]Wheezy outta here\n[Verse 1]\n[00:13.28]They ask me how high am I, I said I'm higher than this\n[00:15.12]They say, \"You could die like this\"\n[00:16.88]They ask me if I'm in love, I said, \"In love like a bitch\"\n[00:20.62]They said I could die like this\n[00:22.58]I asked them, \"What'd happen if I take two shots of the gin?\"\n[00:26.36]After all the Percs I did\n[00:28.28]I asked them, \"What happens if I put a hole in his head?\"\n[00:31.96]He was talkin' all that shit\n[Chorus]\n[00:34.46]Damn, talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again\n[00:42.98]Talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again\n[00:46.86]Talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again, again\n[Verse 2]\n[00:56.48]My conscience haunts me like a ghost in an old house\n[01:02.48]Tell me what you know 'bout the pain, what you know 'bout?\n[01:05.30]Tell me you know how it feels to never wanna go out, uh\n[01:09.00]Anti, Percs to the— got me scratchin'\n[01:12.86]Ain't no such thing as relaxin' without relapsing\n[01:16.72]Does someone have a pill bottle they can pass me?\n[Chorus]\n[01:19.54]Damn, talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again\n[01:26.62]Talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again\n[01:32.32]Talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again, again (Wheezy outta here)\n[Verse 3]\n[01:43.02]If it isn't one thing, then it's definitely the other\n[01:45.58]I get so high off of Percocets, I start seeing different colors\n[01:48.38]I get so high off of lean, everything in slow motion to me\n[01:51.18]Everything's just how it's supposed to be\n[01:52.56]So high, it's heavenly\n[01:53.72]I put love and drugs in the same box\n[01:55.40]Girl, you better off dodgin' raindrops\n[01:56.84]Thinkin' you was finna get me off the straight drop\n[01:58.20]That's a cap, that's a hell nah\n[01:59.70]Live my life like San Andreas\n[02:01.08]Let a nigga try to take it\n[02:02.52]We'll hang him like we racist\n[02:04.00]After that, we'll send him to Satan\n[Chorus]\n[02:05.18]Damn, talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again\n[02:14.94]Talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again\n[02:21.62]Talkin' to the voices again, talkin' to the voices again, again","words":[[10.48,11.18,"They"],[11.44,11.66,"ask"],[11.72,11.76,"me"],[11.9,12.1,"how"],[12.14,12.36,"high"],[12.4,12.54,"am"],[12.78,12.78,"I"],[12.82,12.98,"Wheezy"],[13.02,13.14,"outta"],[13.18,13.24,"here"],[13.28,13.34,"They"],[13.38,13.42,"ask"],[13.46,13.48,"me"],[13.56,13.64,"how"],[13.68,13.8,"high"],[13.84,13.86,"am"],[13.9,13.9,"I,"],[13.94,13.94,"I"],[13.98,14.04,"said"],[14.08,14.14,"I'm"],[14.18,14.42,"higher"],[14.56,14.92,"than"],[14.96,15.06,"this"],[15.12,15.18,"They"],[15.22,15.28,"say,"],[15.32,15.36,"\"You"],[15.42,15.58,"could"],[15.66,15.96,"die"],[16.0,16.32,"like"],[16.36,16.58,"this\""],[16.88,17.0,"They"],[17.14,17.28,"ask"],[17.4,17.44,"me"],[17.68,17.76,"if"],[17.86,18.04,"I'm"],[18.1,18.18,"in"],[18.24,18.52,"love,"],[18.66,18.66,"I"],[18.76,18.98,"said,"],[19.06,19.12,"\"In"],[19.2,19.42,"love"],[19.5,19.7,"like"],[19.76,19.76,"a"],[19.92,20.22,"bitch\""],[20.62,20.72,"They"],[20.78,20.96,"said"],[21.08,21.08,"I"],[21.12,21.26,"could"],[21.32,21.64,"die"],[21.7,22.16,"like"],[22.38,22.52,"this"],[22.58,22.58,"I"],[22.62,22.98,"asked"],[23.08,23.22,"them,"],[23.3,23.46,"\"What'd"],[23.5,23.94,"happen"],[24.04,24.14,"if"],[24.32,24.32,"I"],[24.42,24.64,"take"],[24.68,24.74,"two"],[24.88,25.16,"shots"],[25.26,25.3,"of"],[25.36,25.44,"the"],[25.58,25.86,"gin?\""],[26.36,26.56,"After"],[26.64,26.76,"all"],[26.82,26.88,"the"],[26.96,27.32,"Percs"],[27.68,27.68,"I"],[28.06,28.16,"did"],[28.28,28.28,"I"],[28.5,28.7,"asked"],[28.74,28.88,"them,"],[28.96,29.08,"\"What"],[29.18,29.64,"happens"],[29.72,29.82,"if"],[29.96,29.96,"I"],[30.1,30.34,"put"],[30.44,30.44,"a"],[30.58,30.88,"hole"],[30.96,31.